        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86656, Select Knurled Cabinet T-Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Knurled Cabinet Pull is available in two sizes and completely customizable. The rectangular stem mount and the t-bar are separate pieces fitted together so you can choose any combination of finishes that suits your style. The knurled texture has maximum design impact. This modern cabinet pull is perfect for your kitchen remodel.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86656-specifications.gif?v=1774586582\" width=\"600\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Knurled Cabinet Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Select Knurled Cabinet T-Bar Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86656:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86657:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Finish7SCU.jpg?v=1704354538\" width=\"600\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
